# LMS Coding Platform - Application Flows

Các flow này dùng route API trong `docs/specs/api_spec.md` và status trong `docs/DATABASE.txt`.

## 1. Auth và session

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant Auth as Auth Provider
    participant App as Business API

    User->>FE: Register
    FE->>Auth: POST /auth/register
    Auth-->>FE: Verification challenge
    User->>FE: Enter OTP
    FE->>Auth: POST /auth/verify-otp
    Auth-->>FE: Account activated
    User->>FE: Login
    FE->>Auth: POST /auth/login
    Auth-->>FE: Authorization code
    FE->>Auth: POST /auth/code
    Auth-->>FE: HttpOnly session cookies
    FE->>App: GET /api/v1/users/me
    App->>Auth: Verify JWT with JWK
    App-->>FE: Profile, roles and permissions
```

## 2. Student đăng ký Teacher

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant FE as Student UI
    participant Storage as Object Storage
    participant API as Business API
    participant Worker as Scan/OCR Worker
    actor Admin

    Student->>FE: Complete application and select files
    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/uploads/presign
    API-->>FE: Private presigned URLs
    FE->>Storage: Upload CCCD and CV
    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/uploads/{id}/complete
    API->>Worker: Scan and OCR documents
    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/teacher-applications
    API->>API: Create TeacherProfile + Draft application
    FE->>API: POST /teacher-applications/{id}/submit
    API-->>FE: PENDING
    Admin->>API: GET /admin/teacher-applications/{id}
    API-->>Admin: Application + signed files + advisory OCR
    alt Approve
        Admin->>API: POST /admin/teacher-applications/{id}/approve
        API->>API: Set APPROVED and activate Teacher role
    else Reject with note
        Admin->>API: POST /admin/teacher-applications/{id}/reject
        API->>API: Set REJECTED
        Student->>API: PATCH application and resubmit
    end
```

## 3. Teacher tạo và gửi duyệt Course

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT: Teacher creates course
    DRAFT --> PENDING_REVIEW: Teacher submits valid course
    PENDING_REVIEW --> PUBLISHED: Admin approves
    PENDING_REVIEW --> REJECTED: Admin rejects with note
    REJECTED --> DRAFT: Teacher edits
    DRAFT --> PENDING_REVIEW: Teacher resubmits
    PUBLISHED --> ARCHIVED: Teacher/Admin archives
    ARCHIVED --> DRAFT: Authorized restore
```

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor Teacher
    participant FE as Teacher Studio
    participant API as Business API
    actor Admin

    Teacher->>API: POST /api/v1/teacher/courses
    API-->>FE: DRAFT course
    Teacher->>API: Create sections, lessons and typed contents
    Teacher->>API: PUT curriculum-order with version
    Teacher->>API: POST course/{id}/submit-review
    API-->>FE: PENDING_REVIEW
    Admin->>API: GET /admin/course-reviews/{id}
    alt Checklist passes
        Admin->>API: POST course-reviews/{id}/approve
        API-->>FE: PUBLISHED
    else Reject with note
        Admin->>API: POST course-reviews/{id}/reject
        API-->>FE: REJECTED + review history
    end
```

## 4. Cart, Order, PayOS và Enrollment

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant FE as Commerce UI
    participant API as Business API
    participant PayOS
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Events as Outbox/Worker

    Student->>API: PUT /api/v1/cart/items/{course_id}
    API->>DB: Reject if already enrolled
    Student->>API: POST /api/v1/orders + Idempotency-Key
    API->>DB: Create one-course PENDING order
    Student->>API: POST /orders/{id}/checkout/payos
    API->>PayOS: Create payment link
    PayOS-->>FE: Redirect/QR through API response
    PayOS->>API: Signed webhook
    API->>API: Verify signature and deduplicate
    API->>DB: Complete transaction and order atomically
    API->>DB: Create Enrollment once
    API->>DB: Write 80% Teacher and 20% Platform ledger
    API->>Events: PAYMENT notification/audit event
    FE->>API: GET /orders/{id}/payment-result
    API-->>FE: COMPLETED + enrollment_id
```

Browser redirect không tạo Enrollment. Webhook lỗi, expired hoặc cancelled không cấp quyền học.

## 5. Learning progress và Quiz

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Open enrolled curriculum] --> B{Content type}
    B -->|Reading| C[Render sanitized reading]
    B -->|Video| D[Send position and duration]
    B -->|Quiz| E[Create numbered attempt]
    B -->|Problem| F[Open Online Judge]
    C --> G[Reading progress only]
    D --> H{Watched 100 percent?}
    H -->|No| I[IN_PROGRESS]
    H -->|Yes| J[COMPLETED]
    E --> K[Backend scores answers]
    K --> L{Score meets pass score?}
    L -->|Yes| J
    L -->|No and retry remains| I
    L -->|No and attempts exhausted| M[LOCKED computed state]
    F --> N{Accepted and score meets policy?}
    N -->|Yes| J
    N -->|No| I
```

Progress status và lock state do backend tính; FE không gửi lệnh complete cho Video, Quiz hoặc Problem.

## 6. Online Judge

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant FE as Monaco Workspace
    participant API as Business API
    participant Queue as RabbitMQ
    participant Judge as Judge Service
    participant Box as Docker Sandbox
    participant RT as SSE

    Student->>API: POST /problems/{slug}/submissions + Idempotency-Key
    API-->>FE: PENDING submission_id
    API->>Queue: Dispatch submission
    Queue->>Judge: Consume job
    Judge->>Box: Compile/run without network and with limits
    Box-->>Judge: Testcase statuses/runtime/memory
    Judge->>API: Persist terminal result
    Judge->>RT: Publish status event
    RT-->>FE: PENDING -> RUNNING -> terminal
    FE->>API: GET /submissions/{id}
    API-->>FE: Result with hidden testcase projection
```

## 7. AI Interview

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant FE as Interview UI
    participant API as Business API
    participant Gemini as Gemini Adapter
    participant Worker as Report Worker

    Student->>FE: Select topic/level and optional media permissions
    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/interview-sessions
    API->>Gemini: Generate first question
    API-->>FE: ACTIVE session + question 1
    loop Until AI early finish or question 12
        Student->>FE: Answer by text or normalized transcript
        FE->>API: POST /sessions/{id}/answers
        API->>Gemini: Conversation text + prompt version
        Gemini-->>API: Next question or finish
        API-->>FE: Next question/state
    end
    API->>API: Set REPORT_GENERATING
    API->>Worker: Generate one final report
    Worker->>Gemini: Evaluate saved text
    Gemini-->>Worker: Scores and feedback
    Worker->>API: Save report and set COMPLETED
    API-->>FE: AI_REPORT notification
```

Audio/video recording không được upload hoặc persistence.

## 8. Teacher wallet và payout

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING: Teacher requests amount >= 1000 VND
    PENDING --> REJECTED: Admin rejects with note
    PENDING --> APPROVED: Admin approves and reserves balance
    APPROVED --> PROCESSING: Settlement starts
    PROCESSING --> COMPLETED: Settlement succeeds
    PROCESSING --> FAILED: Settlement fails and reserve is released
```

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor Teacher
    participant API as Business API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    actor Admin
    participant Settlement as Bank/Settlement Worker

    Teacher->>API: POST /teacher/payout-requests + Idempotency-Key
    API->>DB: Validate available balance and minimum
    API-->>Teacher: PENDING
    Admin->>API: Approve or reject
    alt Approved
        API->>DB: Reserve balance and mark APPROVED
        API->>Settlement: Send payout
        alt Success
            Settlement->>DB: Write payout debit and COMPLETED
        else Failure
            Settlement->>DB: Write compensating ledger and FAILED
        end
    else Rejected
        API->>DB: Save REJECTED + reviewed note
    end
```

## 9. Cross-cutting events

Payment, Teacher review, Course review, Judge result, AI report và Payout phát domain event qua transactional outbox. Notification worker phải idempotent; audit log lưu actor, action, target, note, request/trace ID và timestamp.
